(text "VBUS_IN = WeAct H1-1 (raw USB VBUS, before the module's diode U2). F1 = 500 mA PTC (JP2 shorts it),\nD2 = SS34 (DNP, JP1 bridged) -> +5V_LOGIC. H1-2 (+5V after the diode) is NOT used: the drop could take the AHCT below 4.5 V.\n+3V3 comes from the module LDO (H2-5/H2-6, sheet 'WeAct module'). H2-3 3V3_EN, H1-5 VREF and H2-8 RUN stay unconnected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "03717600-bc8c-58d3-85f7-1a68831ac623"))
